  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模组。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于本模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>农作物补种是一款极简主义模组，它能利用掉落物中的种子自动补种已收获的作物。默认情况下，玩家需要手持锄头才能触发补种，但此设置可在配置中调整。按住潜行键可以阻止补种。<br><br>4.0 版本增加了对扩展了 CropBlock 的模组作物的支持。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于《原版体验》整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的生活质量模组包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>mustHoldHoeForReplanting</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>若启用，玩家必须手持锄头才能自动补种作物。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><span><strong>适用于小麦、胡萝卜、马铃薯、甜菜根、下界疣、可可豆以及各种模组作物。</strong></span></span></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/j.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>你想同时收获多少作物都行。掉落物将用于补种下方的作物。</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/g.webp\" alt=\"gif1\" width=\"848\" height=\"476\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><br><span><strong>按住潜行键，作物将不会被补种。清理农场时非常有用！</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/h.webp\" alt=\"gif2\" width=\"850\" height=\"476\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><br><span><strong>同样适用于下界疣和可可豆：</strong><br></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/i.webp\" alt=\"gif3\" width=\"846\" height=\"392\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组，前提是下载链接仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>有关问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
